      <h2 class="font-bold block text-md mb-2">This website uses cookies to ensure you get the best experience.</h2>

      <p class="mb-2">
        Epiminds and our selected partners use cookies and similar technologies (together “cookies”) that are necessary to present this website, and to ensure you get the best experience of it.

          If you consent to it, we will also use cookies for analytics purposes.
